  <span class="kicker">Client case study · Bristol</span><h1>Marvel Desserts</h1>
  <p class="lede">Marvel Desserts had been trading for years without a proper website. The first build gives customers somewhere clear to find the business, its offer, and its locations.</p>
  <img class="case-image" src="/work/marvel-desserts-site.png" alt="Marvel Desserts website maintenance screen" />
  <h2>The problem</h2><p>The business had no established website and Google Business Profile control remained with a previous manager.</p>
  <h2>What I changed</h2><p>I built the website, shaped the content around customer questions, and am helping the owners recover access to the Google Business Profile. The website is currently in a temporary maintenance state while updates are being made.</p>
  <h2>Evidence</h2><p>Cloudflare Analytics showed 873 unique visitors and 12.12k requests in the 30-day snapshot captured on 22 October 2026. This is a traffic snapshot, not a claim that the site is currently open.</p>
